message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names. See "Citation metadata" in the contributing guide
  (`CONTRIBUTING.md`) for who is an author and how to add or correct your
  entry.
title: proWES
abstract: >-
  proWES is a gateway for the GA4GH Workflow Execution Service (WES) API that
  federates WES instances. Clients send their workflow runs to proWES as to
  any WES instance; proWES forwards each run to a WES instance and tracks its
  state. It is built with FOCA and deployed with Docker Compose or its Helm
  chart.
